      <file>.claude/constraints/testing.md</file>
    </files>
  </knowledge>

  <notes>
    Implemented on branch task/163-policy-server-read (PR into docs/ontology-platform-design). Full notes, the caller-read inventory, test counts and the publish delta: notes/task-163-notes.md. Live roles and the dev grid configuration are NOT changed; the main session applies them after the BFF deploy (BFF, then config, then roles).
    rework: none task 163
